<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Hug Roger III of Pallars Sobirà</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1503</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Hug Roger III was the last count of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pallars">Pallars</a> Sobirà in the Catalan <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pyrenees">Pyrenees</a>. He sided with the Generalitat against John II in the Catalan civil war of 1462–1472 and later resisted Ferdinand II, who defeated him in 1487 and confiscated his county, granting it to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cardona">Cardona</a> family. He spent his last years as a prisoner in the castle of Xàtiva.</p></div>
